{"seq":6,"slug":"industrial-internet","title":"职业本科工业互联网","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet","introMarkdown":"# 职业本科工业互联网\n\n让我先说说我自己是怎么对这个领域产生兴趣的。我曾经在一家做注塑件的工厂里待过一段时间，车间里几十台机器轰隆作响，但每台设备的运行数据却几乎都锁在各自的控制柜里，谁也看不见。一旦某台机器突然停机，往往要等老师傅跑过去拆开看，才知道是哪个传感器坏了。那时我第一次冒出一个念头：如果这些机器能像手机一样联网、把数据汇到一块屏幕上，是不是就能提前知道哪里要出问题？后来我才知道，这个念头有个专门的名字——工业互联网。\n\n工业互联网并不是把工厂搬到网页上那么简单。它要解决的是一个很现实的矛盾：工厂里的设备种类繁多、协议各异、对实时性和安全性的要求又极高，而上层的管理者、工程师却需要统一、干净、可分析的数据。这中间隔着的，正是一整套体系、网络、平台和应用。\n\n这个学科适合像你我这样从零开始、想搞懂\"机器如何上云、数据如何变成价值\"的自学者。它跨越了自动化、通信、计算机和数据科学几个领域，听起来吓人，但只要顺着一条清晰的主线走下去，其实并不难入门。\n\n我把整个学习路径拆成了四个章节，对应四个层层递进的问题：\n\n第一章讲体系与架构，回答\"工业互联网到底长什么样\"。我们会认识国际上的几套参考架构，理解\"边缘—云\"协同这个贯穿全书的核心思路。\n\n第二章钻进网络与协议层，回答\"机器之间怎么说话\"。从传统现场总线，到时间敏感网络 TSN，再到 OPC UA 和 MQTT 这对在 2026 年已成行业共识的黄金组合。\n\n第三章上升到平台与数据层，回答\"海量数据怎么管、怎么用\"。这里有工业互联网平台的角色、数据采集与建模的方法，以及近两年最火的数字孪生。\n\n第四章落到应用层，回答\"这些技术到底能做什么\"。我们会看工业 APP 的开发逻辑、预测性维护这个最经典的场景，以及安全与未来趋势。\n\n学习这门课不需要你先成为某个领域的专家。我建议你带着工厂里那台\"突然停机的机器\"作为思考的锚点，每学到一个新概念，就回头问自己：它能不能帮我提前发现那台机器的问题？这样学下来，你会发现所有零散的知识点最终都串成了一条完整的链路：从设备的一个振动信号，到云端的一次预警推送。\n\n准备好了吗？我们从最基础的问题开始：工业互联网究竟是什么。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"architecture-and-system","title":"工业互联网体系与架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/architecture-and-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-industrial-internet","title":"工业互联网是什么","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/architecture-and-system/what-is-industrial-internet"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reference-architecture","title":"工业互联网参考架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/architecture-and-system/reference-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"edge-cloud-collaboration","title":"边缘与云协同","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/architecture-and-system/edge-cloud-collaboration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"networks-and-protocols","title":"工业网络与通信协议","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/networks-and-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-network-basics","title":"工业网络基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/networks-and-protocols/industrial-network-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fieldbus-and-tsn","title":"现场总线与时间敏感网络","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/networks-and-protocols/fieldbus-and-tsn"},{"seq":3,"slug":"opcua-and-mqtt","title":"OPC UA 与 MQTT","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/networks-and-protocols/opcua-and-mqtt"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-and-data","title":"平台与数据","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-internet-platform","title":"工业互联网平台","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data/industrial-internet-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-collection-and-modeling","title":"数据采集与建模","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data/data-collection-and-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-twin","title":"数字孪生","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/platform-and-data/digital-twin"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"apps-and-smart-manufacturing","title":"工业APP与智能制造应用","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/apps-and-smart-manufacturing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-apps","title":"工业APP","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/apps-and-smart-manufacturing/industrial-apps"},{"seq":2,"slug":"predictive-maintenance","title":"预测性维护","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/apps-and-smart-manufacturing/predictive-maintenance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-and-trends","title":"安全与未来趋势","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/industrial-internet/apps-and-smart-manufacturing/security-and-trends"}]}]}